0,8403900,2758900,9448300,11804600,59161400,85449900,14025300,10540300,30472600,10381800,10031600,42161800,13845400,6726100,5557600,7048000,9396600,13841300,59543900,161863300,107874000,40226900,66419100,8660400,10728400,76539400,30815900,18284900,58563500,124248300,41804200,13123000,8190100,5846900,5982900,13949000,4411500,2920900,2671600,12111300,3686600,3757100,1349800,3462300,3035500,2694400,1242700,566800,2595900,3125200,1970700,1811700,19029600,1080500,8900800,32854900,17154400,38555900,3791800,1849100,5884300,2259400,12253500,2480500,6274700,2834500,8437400,8784600,11403700,4573300,2119500,1326600,8716900,6516400,16591900,32099300,119091000,111246300,14503200,8853700,3204300,7095000,9953600,9535100,7562600,5572000,3091200,2517800,6816200,5634200,6854600,4425000,4975700,2877700,9755500,3054600,3478700]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.advancecon.com.my","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","employees":null,"city":"Petaling Jaya","summary":"Advancecon Holdings Berhad, together with its subsidiaries, provides earthworks and civil engineering services in Malaysia. The company operates through five segments: Construction and Support Services; Property Investments; Green Energy; Quarry Operations; and Property Development. The Construction and Support Services segment is involved in earthworks and civil engineering. The Property Investments segment engages in sales of investment properties for capital gain and rental of investment properties. The Green Energy segment develops and operates power generation from renewable energy, solar, and other renewable energy projects. The Quarry Operations segment operates contracted quarry. The Property Development is involved in involved in the development of industrial park and provides workers' dormitory/accommodation services. It is also involved in the sale of construction materials; sale of quarry and premix products; provides port services; hires earth-moving machineries and transportation agent; supply of labour; and contracting in all types of construction works and other related businesses. In addition, the company offers civil engineering services, construction of main drains, road works, sewerage systems and hiring services of heavy machinery and equipment. Advancecon Holdings Berhad was incorporated in 1997 and is headquartered in Petaling Jaya, Malaysia.","zh":"Advancecon Holdings Berhad 是一家马来西亚公司，成立于1997年，总部位于八打灵再也，通过子公司提供土方工程和土木工程服务。公司运营五个业务板块：建筑与支持服务、物业投资、绿色能源、采石场运营和物业开发。","lines":["建筑与支持服务：从事土方工程和土木工程，包括主排水沟、道路工程、污水处理系统建设，以及重型机械和设备租赁、劳动力供应和建筑材料销售。","物业投资：销售投资性物业以获取资本收益，并出租投资性物业。","绿色能源：开发并运营可再生能源发电项目，包括太阳能和其他可再生能源项目。","采石场运营：运营承包采石场，并销售采石场和预混产品。","物业开发：开发工业园区，并提供工人宿舍/住宿服务。"],"lines_en":["Construction and Support Services: Engages in earthworks and civil engineering, including main drains, road works, sewerage systems, heavy machinery and equipment hiring, labour supply, and sale of construction materials.","Property Investments: Involves sales of investment properties for capital gain and rental of investment properties.","Green Energy: Develops and operates power generation from renewable energy, solar, and other renewable energy projects.","Quarry Operations: Operates contracted quarry and sells quarry and premix products.","Property Development: Involves development of industrial park and provides workers' dormitory/accommodation services."]}}